विष्टभ्याहमिदं कृत्स्नमेकांशेन स्थितो जगत् ॥ ४२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3117,\"bb\":2754,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/42/b2754/\",\"body_value\":\"atha vā bahunaitena
kiṁ jñātena tavārjuna
